  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Plc 200) #13427, eff 8-4-22; ss by #13837, eff 12-28-23 (formerly Plc 202.17) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Plc 200); ss by #14136, eff 12-1-24 (formerly Plc 202.27)",
